        <summary>Set the ControlTemplate to define the primary user interaction Devices may support a variety of user interactions, and all interactions cannot be represented with a single ControlTemplate.</summary>
        <returns>Existing return documentation.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Set the ControlTemplate to define the primary user interaction Devices may support a variety of user interactions, and all interactions cannot be represented with a single ControlTemplate. Therefore, the selected template should be most closely aligned with what the expected primary device action will be. Any secondary interactions can be done via the setAppIntent(PendingIntent).</para>
